    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've been seeing a lot of stuff online from people saying that these mandates are basically just a way for pharmaceutical companies to force products on kids and that the concerns about safety are just baseless conspiracy theories used to stall progress. is that a fair way to characterize the opposition, or is there more to it?)",
